     6	whose main() would merge against the WD roster and rewrite the published
     7	catalog table. Per-star JSONs are the product; no roster merge, no CSV — the
     8	campaign metrics read the JSONs directly (METRICS_SPEC.md).
     9	
    10	Resumability is inherited from analyze_star: a complete result file is
    11	returned untouched, so re-running after a crash or shard split is safe.
